{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12Destinations8DeliveryV17bufferDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA06BufferD6ReportVGvp","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"bufferDropReports","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Delivery.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Delivery.swift#L50"}},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bufferDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/BufferDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations16BufferDropReportV","text":"BufferDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports no one has read yet merge, one per destination: a destination’s later drops add","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their record counts to its waiting report and widen its timestamps, so the reports waiting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are at most one per destination, and a late reader still learns every count lost. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence ends once this delivery, every copy of it and every unit of work built on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/work","type":"reference"},{"text":" are gone, their executions have returned, and every report has been read. Read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence into a constant before starting the task that reads it, so the task holds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports and not the delivery.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/delivery\/bufferdropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of the batches each destination’s full buffer drops, in the order they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Delivery\/bufferDropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/BufferDropReport":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":